-- Tests of Article 73. Expected values are written from the text (15, 2 and 10 days; seven days; the dates of Art 113), before the run.
-- Arguments of the system functions: date asked, route, date placed, changed in design, then the facts in the order of each function's GIVEN.
-- The group General applies from 2 August 2026; the system below is high-risk under Annex III, placed on 2 December 2027 (not saved by Art 111(2)).

`Art 73 test route` MEANS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
`Art 73 test placed` MEANS Date 2 12 2027
`Art 73 test placed earlier` MEANS Date 1 1 2026

